{"id":"de_barrasse_","lemma":"débarrassé","pos":"adj","rank":4178,"glosses":["cleared, removed"],"ipa":"/de.ba.ʁa.se/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bc/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-d%C3%A9barrass%C3%A9.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-d%C3%A9barrass%C3%A9.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"débarrassée","masculinePlural":"débarrassés","femininePlural":"débarrassées"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle a débarrassé la table.","en":"She cleared off the table.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"table"}]},{"text":"Je m'en suis débarrassée.","en":"I got rid of it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null]},{"text":"On s'est débarrassé de tout.","en":"We got rid of everything.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"}]},{"text":"Je me suis débarrassé de tous les livres.","en":"I disposed of all the books.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"book","l":"livre"}]},{"text":"Ils se sont débarrassés des choses inutiles.","en":"They discarded unnecessary things.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},{"g":"useless","l":"inutile"}]}]}